{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01348","headline":"相和歌辞 宫怨 · 于濆","name":"相和歌辞 宫怨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"妾家望江口，少年家财厚。\n临江起珠楼，不卖文君酒。\n当年乐贞独，巢燕时爲友。\n父兄未许人，畏妾事姑舅。\n西墙邻宋玉，窥见妾眉宇。\n一旦及天聪，恩光生户牖。\n谓言入汉宫，富贵可长久。\n君王纵有情，不奈陈皇后。\n谁怜颊似桃，孰知腰胜柳。\n今日在长门，从来不如丑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于濆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}